        <p>Ltirely</p>
        <p>THE MUSICIANS WHO HELPED, tbe The following musicians constituted orchestra:— First violins. Messrs. Pearson (leader), Clare, Young, Young, Shaw and Geary. Second Violins: ' Messrs. Millington Watts, Frain, McKinley, Brough and phreys. Violas: Messrs. Boy and Balmford. 13,0 f • 'Celloes : Messrs. Jackson. Burrows, and Basses: Messrs. Allen and Burrows. Flutes: MessrS. Chapman and Stuart. Oboes: Messrs. Watts and Davies. Clarionets : Messrs. King and Wood. Bassoon: Mr. Jones. Comets: Messrs. Eufter and Allinson. Trombones: Messrs. Hacking and Man° Horns: Messrs. Buckley and Beckwith• Tympani: Mr. Yates. Drums: Mr. Mayers.</p>
