        <p>AND TR,O--Y-A.1., COTT IZT Til HLAJT_ER, THE WAR. MR. 4AOTTOMLEVS VISIT. .Owing to the huge demand for tickets for the Meeting in PARR HALL on TUESDAY NEXT, Mr. HORATIO BOTTOMLEY has consented to address an OVERFLOW MEETING in the ROYAL COURT THEATRE, to which Ladies will he Doors open at 7 p.m.</p>
