        <p>STRENGTHENING' THE COMRADES. LORD DERBY HAS NOW RECEIVED PER- MISSION TO INCREASE THE STRENGTH OF EACH OF THE CITY BATTALIONS, OTHERWISE CALLED THE COMRADES, TO I_loo 09) MEN. THE OFFICES, COOPER'S BUILDINGS, CHURCH-STREET, LIVERPOOL, WILL THEREFORE BE RE- OPENED AT 9 A.M. ON MONDAY NEXT, THE 14TH INST., AND REMAIN OPEN DURING THE WEEK. It is desired to maintain the high standard of these Battalions, and a certain number of selected men will he enlisted. With that object in view, 'applicants must present themselves as early as possible after 9 a.m. on MONDAY NEXT, the 14TH INST., and if selected will, as far as practicable, be posted to the Battalions in which they Lace relatives or friends. JOIN NOW AND SPEND YOUR CHRISTMAS AT HOME.</p>
